-- One-time data update: Istanbul Marble Grand Prix gets a new layout.
--
-- Its own layout (Moses, 6 Nov 2026): until now it raced the same race as Dubai
-- Marble Grand Prix in practice. The crest start from the Galata Tower, the
-- Golden Horn S-bends, the Galata Bridge, the Grand Bazaar spiral (the big
-- feature: a turn and a half round the clock tower; no jump), the Topkapi
-- hairpin, the Bosphorus sweep, the Ortakoy S-bends and the Bosphorus straight;
-- no splitter; new start shots. Its name, slug, look and past races stay. Its
-- track record, country records and players' personal bests start again from
-- now (tracks.records_since); past results stay. Races already run keep their
-- stored replays and play back exactly as they ran.
